### Reintento con la misma clave y el mismo cuerpo (HU5, caso borde)
# Esperado en el servicio real: el mismo 201 con Idempotent-Replayed: true y el mismo id.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010
@token = test-token

POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 9c4a1f0e-3b2d-4c5e-8f7a-6b5c4d3e2f1a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "amount": 250000,
  "term_months": 12,
  "identity_verification_id": "0b9d2f4a-6c1e-4a7b-8d3f-5e6a7b8c9d0e",
  "partner_reference": "ORD-2026-000184"
}

### Misma clave con un cuerpo distinto -> 409 (el header Prefer fuerza la respuesta en Prism)
POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 9c4a1f0e-3b2d-4c5e-8f7a-6b5c4d3e2f1a
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: code=409

{
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "amount": 900000,
  "term_months": 24,
  "identity_verification_id": "0b9d2f4a-6c1e-4a7b-8d3f-5e6a7b8c9d0e"
}
